---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Reviews — 5-Star Rated Landscaping in Central Texas"
description: "Research Turf Management is 5.0-star rated with customers who've stayed for decades. Read real reviews and see why Central Texas trusts our family-owned crew."
---
{% import "partials/icons.njk" as ico %}

<section class="hero hero--page">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero__inner">
      <p class="hero__tagline">5.0★ · Family-owned since {{ site.parentFounded }}</p>
      <h1>Customers who stay for decades</h1>
      <p class="hero__sub">We've earned a perfect rating the slow way — by treating every yard like our own and showing up, year after year, for the same families.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<nav class="wrap crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span>Reviews</nav>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="stats" style="max-width:820px;margin:0 auto 24px">
      <div class="stat"><div class="stat__n">5.0★</div><div class="stat__l">Average rating</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="stat__n">{{ reviews.aggregate.reviewCount }}</div><div class="stat__l">Five-star reviews, family of companies</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="stat__n">30+</div><div class="stat__l">Years with longest customer</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="stat__n">{{ site.trust.bbbRating }}</div><div class="stat__l">BBB rating</div></div>
    </div>
    <p class="muted center narrow" style="margin:0 auto 48px;font-size:.9rem">Excel Pest &amp; Research Turf are one family-owned operation with a shared crew and customer base, so our reviews reflect the whole company. Many reviewers name both the landscaping and the pest side of the business.</p>

    <div class="grid grid-2">
      {% for r in reviews.featured %}
      <figure class="review" style="margin:0">
        <div class="review__stars">★★★★★</div>
        <blockquote class="review__quote" style="border:0;padding:0;margin:0 0 16px">"{{ r.quote }}"</blockquote>
        <figcaption>
          <span class="review__author">{{ r.author }}</span>
          <span class="review__context"> · {{ r.context }}</span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="wrap center narrow" style="margin:0 auto">
    <p class="eyebrow">Worked with us?</p>
    <h2>We'd love your review</h2>
    <p class="lead">If we've taken care of your landscape, a few words on Google means the world to a family business — and helps your neighbors find a crew they can trust.</p>
    <div class="hero__actions" style="justify-content:center">
      <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="{{ site.social.google }}" rel="noopener">Leave a Google Review</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg" href="/contact/">Contact Us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
